        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-muted">
          Material identity, AM process, thermal condition, HIP, surface, machining, orientation, sampling, and
          acceptance evidence determine what the quoted part represents. Supplier equipment and build envelope are
          confirmed only after the actual RFQ is reviewed.
        </p>
      </div>

